        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red alert. The Martians are here.</strong><br>Suit up and launch into orbit in this fast-paced space shooter where you're Earth's last line of defense. Face overwhelming alien forces, dodge relentless bullet hell and suicidal kamikaze attacks, and unleash devastating firepower to purge the Martian threat from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbital Purge</strong> is a linear arcade-style shooter that throws you into intense combat against waves of enemies. As the invaders grow stronger, you'll unlock powerful upgrades to stay alive and wipe them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡<strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Arsenal</strong> – Power up your ship with new weapons and enhancements between bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-firing and upgrading</strong> – Weapons fire automatically and power up on their own as you collect upgrade points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level skipping</strong> – Jump past early levels when starting a new game to get straight to the action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martian Onslaught</strong> – Blast through waves of alien ships coming from Mars in escalating intensity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Hell Dodging</strong> – Evade dense enemy fire while delivering your own devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op </strong>– For up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859020/extras/64da55613effcc0793bc30015f016233.poster.avif?t=1758035933\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859020/extras/64da55613effcc0793bc30015f016233.webm?t=1758035933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859020/extras/64da55613effcc0793bc30015f016233.mp4?t=1758035933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👽 <strong>Wipe them out. Save the planet.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you can stop the red tide. <br>Load up, launch out, and fight for Earth’s survival in <strong>Orbital Purge</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red alert. The Martians are here.</strong><br>Suit up and launch into orbit in this fast-paced space shooter where you're Earth's last line of defense. Face overwhelming alien forces, dodge relentless bullet hell and suicidal kamikaze attacks, and unleash devastating firepower to purge the Martian threat from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbital Purge</strong> is a linear arcade-style shooter that throws you into intense combat against waves of enemies. As the invaders grow stronger, you'll unlock powerful upgrades to stay alive and wipe them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡<strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Arsenal</strong> – Power up your ship with new weapons and enhancements between bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-firing and upgrading</strong> – Weapons fire automatically and power up on their own as you collect upgrade points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level skipping</strong> – Jump past early levels when starting a new game to get straight to the action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martian Onslaught</strong> – Blast through waves of alien ships coming from Mars in escalating intensity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Hell Dodging</strong> – Evade dense enemy fire while delivering your own devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op </strong>– For up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859020/extras/64da55613effcc0793bc30015f016233.poster.avif?t=1758035933\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859020/extras/64da55613effcc0793bc30015f016233.webm?t=1758035933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859020/extras/64da55613effcc0793bc30015f016233.mp4?t=1758035933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👽 <strong>Wipe them out. Save the planet.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you can stop the red tide. <br>Load up, launch out, and fight for Earth’s survival in <strong>Orbital Purge</strong>.</p>",
